# Challenges › Blitz Clock (first to 3, a 60-second clock, no overtime) played
# to the end with the mallet parked and a pause on the way: the match ends on
# the clock or the AI's third goal, and the results show the breakdown.
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click Challenges
until 60 Constrained goals
frames 10
click Blitz Clock
until 60 Start
expect 1 min max
frames 10
click Start
frames 600
save blitz-play
key Escape 2
until 60 =Paused
frames 10
save blitz-pause
click Resume
until 4400 Rail bounces
frames 10
save blitz-results
expect Retry
click Menu
until 60 Daily Challenge
